# Reports

Read **`.spec/features/reports.md`** before adding or changing report types.

Rules:

- New report = entry in `report-registry.ts` + i18n es/en + frontend renderer + update the shipped table in the feature spec (same PR).
- Categories: `sales` | `inventory` | `fiscal` | `financial`.
- Do not call management summaries “libro de ventas SENIAT” without fiscal document identity.
- Prefer calendar-month presets; filter out DRAFT from fiscal totals unless explicitly opted in.
- Engine stays registry-driven; no parallel query frameworks.
